=== 8710.security ===
Updated dependency `pyasn1` to `0.6.3` to mitigate CVE-2026-30922. As this is not a direct dependency, it will not auto-update when upgrading; please be sure to upgrade your local environment.

=== 8722.security ===
Updated dependency `cryptography` to `~46.0.6` to mitigate CVE-2026-34073.
Updated dependency `requests` to `~2.33.0`. to mitigate CVE-2026-25645. As this is not a direct dependency, it will not auto-update when upgrading; please be sure to upgrade your local environment.
Updated development npm dependency `flatted` to `~3.4.2` to mitigate CVE-2026-33228.

=== 6111.fixed ===
Fixed an issue where Contact and Team objects could not be looked up by name alone when creating a ContactAssociation via the REST API.

=== 8465.fixed ===
Fixed an issue where cable terminations for module interfaces incorrectly displayed as "Circuit" instead of showing the device, type, and component fields.

=== 8547.fixed ===
Resolves issues with the job logs DB connection. It now correctly respects `CONN_MAX_AGE` and can recover from errored connections.
=== 8614.fixed ===
Fixed a race condition when running jobs concurrently that could cause multiple threads to modify the `jobs` registry at the same time.
=== 8629.fixed ===
Fixed a scenario where rendering a GitRepository related Jobs "Scheduled Job View" would sometimes show the Job as not installed
=== 8706.fixed ===
Fixed a bug where GraphQL queries that included related objects were not being optimized correctly since upgrading to graphene-django v3.x.
=== 8724.fixed ===
Fixed permission name in `JobRunScheduleButton` in `JobView`.

=== 8725.fixed ===
Fixed an issue where nested job kwargs were not being serialized correctly which caused problems when using Kubernetes jobs.
=== 8748.fixed ===
Fixed a performance issue where the `validated_save()` method was being called unnecessarily on all `VRFDeviceAssignment` objects when adding a new assignment to a VRF.
=== 8759.fixed ===
Fixed an exception related to version control branches and recursive Job execution.

=== 8763.fixed ===
Fix get_config_context and ConfigContexModel annotation for subclasses of Device model
=== 5789.added ===
Added `graphql` and `webhooks` extras features to all `ComponentTemplateModel` subclasses.

=== 8736.added ===
Added `clear_cache` step to `nautobot-server post_upgrade` command.

=== 8747.changed ===
Job profiling results are now available for download as a file attached to the Job Result, rather than only being written to the worker's local filesystem.
